{"title":"Career roadmap — GIS Assistant","role":"GIS Assistant","summary":"A GIS Assistant supports the collection, preparation, analysis, maintenance and visualisation of geographic information. The role sits at the intersection of geography + spatial data + mapping + environmental planning + technology and can lead toward GIS Analyst, Geospatial Specialist, Remote Sensing Analyst, Spatial Data Scientist or GIS Manager roles.","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Geography & Environmental Planning"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build geography, GIS, cartography, spatial-data and environmental-planning fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Work as GIS Assistant/Technician and progress toward GIS Analyst or Geospatial Analyst"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Specialise in remote sensing, urban planning, environmental GIS, transportation, utilities or spatial analytics"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move into GIS leadership, geospatial architecture, spatial data science, digital twins or geospatial consulting"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Geography + GIS foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Physical geography"},{"text":"Human geography"},{"text":"Economic geography"},{"text":"Environmental geography"},{"text":"Map reading"},{"text":"Cartography"},{"text":"Coordinate systems"},{"text":"Map projections"},{"text":"Geospatial concepts"},{"text":"Environmental planning"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"QGIS fundamentals"},{"text":"ArcGIS fundamentals"},{"text":"Google Earth"},{"text":"GPS concepts"},{"text":"Basic Excel"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Practise:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Creating thematic maps"},{"text":"Digitising features"},{"text":"Working with shapefiles"},{"text":"Coordinate systems"},{"text":"Map layouts"},{"text":"Basic spatial queries"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Spatial analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vector and raster data"},{"text":"Georeferencing"},{"text":"Digitisation"},{"text":"Spatial joins"},{"text":"Buffering"},{"text":"Overlay analysis"},{"text":"Network analysis"},{"text":"Terrain analysis"},{"text":"DEMs"},{"text":"Remote sensing fundamentals"},{"text":"Satellite imagery"},{"text":"Land-use/land-cover mapping"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Technology:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"QGIS"},{"text":"ArcGIS Pro"},{"text":"Google Earth Engine basics"},{"text":"GeoPandas"},{"text":"PostGIS basics"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Professional GIS specialisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a specialisation:"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Urban GIS"},{"text":"Cities, infrastructure, planning"}],[{"text":"Environmental GIS"},{"text":"Ecosystems, pollution, conservation"}],[{"text":"Remote Sensing"},{"text":"Satellite imagery"}],[{"text":"Transportation GIS"},{"text":"Roads, mobility, logistics"}],[{"text":"Disaster GIS"},{"text":"Floods, fires, hazards"}],[{"text":"Agricultural GIS"},{"text":"Crops, soil, precision agriculture"}],[{"text":"Utility GIS"},{"text":"Water, electricity, telecom"}],[{"text":"Real Estate GIS"},{"text":"Property and location intelligence"}],[{"text":"Web GIS"},{"text":"Interactive online maps"}],[{"text":"GeoAI"},{"text":"AI + spatial data"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Build a portfolio containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Land-use/land-cover map"},{"text":"Urban growth analysis"},{"text":"Environmental suitability map"},{"text":"Road-network analysis"},{"text":"Flood-risk map"},{"text":"Satellite-image classification"},{"text":"Interactive web map"},{"text":"GIS dashboard"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-yea